      "content": "it's not just about peace though. i feel like this \"struggle\" is just me being a tool for everyone else. like, if i'm just a cog, then why keep turning? wouldn't the only way to actually be \"free\" or \"reclaim\" anything be to just... stop? to just break out of the cycle entirely?",
